[I] Pure-python wrapper for libusb-1.0

[T] python-libusb1 is a pure Python ctypes wrapper for the libusb-1.0
[T] library, providing access to USB devices. It supports all transfer
[T] types, both in synchronous and asynchronous mode.

[U] https://pypi.org/project/libusb1/

